{
  "info": {
    "name": "Pandy Post API",
    "description": "Collection completa da API do Pandy Post.\n\n## Como usar\n1. Defina a variável `base_url` (padrão: http://localhost:9000/api).\n2. Rode **Auth > Público > Login** — o token é salvo automaticamente na variável `token` (script na aba *Tests*).\n3. Todas as rotas autenticadas herdam o Bearer Token da collection.\n\n## Variáveis\n- `base_url`: base da API\n- `token`: Bearer token (preenchido pelo login)\n- `user_uuid`, `workspace_uuid`, `role_uuid`, `access_uuid`, `plan_uuid`, `price_uuid`, `payment_uuid`, `payment_method_id`, `social_account_uuid`, `pipeline_uuid`, `invite_uuid`, `permission_uuid`, `platform`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:9000/api" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "user_uuid", "value": "" },
    { "key": "workspace_uuid", "value": "" },
    { "key": "role_uuid", "value": "" },
    { "key": "access_uuid", "value": "" },
    { "key": "plan_uuid", "value": "" },
    { "key": "price_uuid", "value": "" },
    { "key": "payment_uuid", "value": "" },
    { "key": "payment_method_id", "value": "pm_card_visa" },
    { "key": "social_account_uuid", "value": "" },
    { "key": "pipeline_uuid", "value": "" },
    { "key": "invite_uuid", "value": "" },
    { "key": "permission_uuid", "value": "" },
    { "key": "platform", "value": "youtube" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Público",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Signup",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"João Silva\",\n  \"email\": \"joao@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"senha12345\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"senha12345\"\n}"
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/signup", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "signup"] },
                "description": "Cria uma nova conta. throttle:3,1. Campos: name, email (único), password (min:8, confirmed)."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Login",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "const res = pm.response.json();",
                      "const token = res.token || res.access_token || (res.data && res.data.token);",
                      "if (token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token', token); console.log('Token salvo.'); }"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"joao@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"senha12345\",\n  \"remember_me\": true\n}"
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["login"] },
                "description": "Autentica e retorna o token. throttle:55,1. O token é salvo automaticamente na variável `token`."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Forgot Password",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"joao@example.com\"\n}" },
                "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/forgot-password", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "forgot-password"] },
                "description": "Envia e-mail de redefinição de senha. throttle:3,1."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Password Reset",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"TOKEN_RECEBIDO_POR_EMAIL\",\n  \"email\": \"joao@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"novaSenha123\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"novaSenha123\"\n}"
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/password-reset", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "password-reset"] },
                "description": "Redefine a senha usando o token recebido por e-mail. throttle:3,1."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Confirm Email",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"TOKEN_DE_VERIFICACAO\"\n}" },
                "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/confirm-email", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "confirm-email"] },
                "description": "Confirma o e-mail via token. throttle:10,1."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Autenticado",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Me",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/me", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["me"] },
                "description": "Retorna o usuário autenticado."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Logout",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/logout", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["logout"] },
                "description": "Revoga o token atual."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Resend Email Verification",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/resend-email-verification", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "resend-email-verification"] },
                "description": "Reenvia o e-mail de verificação. throttle:3,1."
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
